    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      395.12,
      540.16,
      429.2
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under section 55 of the Pawn Brokers Statute No. 3 of 2017 of the North Central ProvinceI, M.P. Jayasinghe, Governor of the North Central Province do hereby declare that the following orders pertaining to thebusiness of Pawn broking shall come into effect from 1st January, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      280.56,
      441.2,
      307.76,
      451.28
    ],
    "text": "Orders",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.0,
      463.04,
      265.16,
      473.12
    ],
    "text": "1. Registration fee, Annual License fee and Security",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.0,
      475.04,
      444.09,
      509.12
    ],
    "text": "i.Registration fee for a Pawn Broking Business - Section 4(1)Rs. 25,000.00ii.Annual License fee for a Pawn Broking Business - Section 9(1)Rs. 5,000.00iii. Security to be deposit to be made by a license holder - Section 7(1)Rs. 100,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.0,
      520.16,
      117.96,
      530.23
    ],
    "text": "2. Interest Rate",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.0,
      532.16,
      539.77,
      554.23
    ],
    "text": "The rate of interest on every rupee or a fraction of a rupee lent shall be two cents for every month or part thereof - SectionII (Section 20)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.0,
      565.04,
      540.42,
      575.11
    ],
    "text": "3. Whenever, the transactions of pawning is taken place the Pawn Broker should ensure that the copy of National Identity",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      66.0,
      577.04,
      516.61,
      587.11
    ],
    "text": "Card, valid Passport or Driving License of the person concern, should be obtained and kept under safe custody.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
